The desk merged every date-related report into one ticket and marked it known: one parser bug, one fix queued. The export’s own `causes.ts` says otherwise: the cause follows the **tenant locale** and the **booking form**, not the intake tag or the subject line. This page is the split the desk still needs.

<Callout kind="warn">
#4471 holds more than one root cause. Open a ticket per cause below; do not treat the merged ticket as a single fix.
</Callout>

